arm64-only, and a server that never exits, so no harness can grade it (a .arch-only would not help): it calibrates its poll interval through Arm64NetCalibrate, which reads CNTVCT_EL0/CNTFRQ_EL0 and cannot compile on the x86-64 bed. Graded by hand: build/test-cross.ps1 -Arch arm64 -Test arm64-web-server compiles it (drop this file), and build/boot-arm64.ps1 -Src codex\test\arm64-web-server.codex -TimeoutSec 120 serves HTTP 200 on the printed hostfwd port.
